WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.310
Seal a reversible reaction
inside a flask, and watch.

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.730
At first, the amounts of
everything change quickly.

3
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:11.370
Then, after a while, they
stop changing altogether.

4
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.690
Nothing seems to be
happening any more.

5
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.410
Has the reaction stopped?

6
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.710
Or is it still running, flat
out, in both directions at once?

7
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.510
In this mission, you'll
meet reversible reactions,

8
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.310
and the special arrow that shows
a reaction can go both ways.

9
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.810
You'll find out what equilibrium
means in a closed system,

10
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.930
and see how changing the
conditions can shift where the

11
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.650
reaction settles.

12
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.250
Your mission: decide whether
a reaction at equilibrium has

13
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.380
stopped.
